  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_c97adc88-c4df-4f70-8715-ec3523f496cf.png\" width=\"170\" height=\"170\"> </strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Create 推进：模拟版</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JHcArsDhh4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.3.1/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"192\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Propulsion-Team/create-propulsion-simulated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.3.1/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_35635d47-00d4-48c0-9758-f7374d6c60e1.png\" alt=\"oimars 设计的涡桨飞机\" width=\"824\" height=\"451\"></p>\n<p><strong>Create 推进：模拟版</strong> 是一款适用于 Minecraft 1.21.1 的 NeoForge 模组，将专注于推进系统的 Create 玩法引入到 Sable + Create Aeronautics 生态中。</p>\n<p>它添加了三种推进器类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推进器：基于常规燃料的推进</li>\n<li>离子推进器：由 FE（能量）驱动的推进</li>\n<li>创造模式推进器：可配置的高功率推进器，用于测试与创造模式建造</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_8a595293-7cd5-49e8-9d5f-a8ac0914ef16.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">该模组直接整合了 Sable 与 Create Aeronautics 的器械物理系统，包括力点行为以实现准确的扭矩计算，并支持组装载具的多推进器协同运作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_584f5630-6017-4404-a24a-3944f5fdb83e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">它还包含 Copycat 翅膀，支持轻量级空气动力学建造，并提供 Copycat 风格的视觉自定义功能。</p>\n<p><br><strong>推进器支持以下模组的燃料：</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: The Factory Must Grow</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Crafts &amp; Additions</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Diesel Generators</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism: Generators</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/northstar-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Northstar: Redux</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stellaris</a></p>\n<p><strong>特别鸣谢：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PacificCyan</strong> - 离子推进器模型、珊瑚发电机模型</li>\n<li><strong>FoxyFox909 </strong> - 多方块推进器</li>\n<li><strong>DeltaSF</strong> - 1.20.1 原版 Create: Propulsion 创作者</li>\n<li><strong>Fleugle </strong> - 重新制作的推进器模型/材质</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
